      "side": 1,
      "message": "My concern is not with immediately converting to Bazel, just that we do not add something to Soong that is not convertable to Bazel.  As far as I understand, Bazel will not allow the rules for a module in art/compiler/ to access files in art/ without an explicit filegroup module in art/.  If that\u0027s the case then we should do it now in Soong too so we are not adding more complexity to the later conversion.",
